id: pm-web-ummd
title: Isolate omit-dev fixtures from ancestor pm-ops installations
description: "The inherited ESM fixture case is tracked by pm-web-sspv. This distinct follow-up concerns omit-dev fixtures nested below an installed checkout: test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts creates consumers under tmpdir(), and scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts resolves pm-ops using createRequire from the consumer package. Node can then find an ancestor node_modules/pm-ops even though that consumer omitted dev dependencies. Main 874ef8f retains this lookup shape. Isolate the fixture dependency search scope without weakening launcher behavior, assertions or production package lookup."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-07T21:55:33.919Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T11:49:26.019Z"
author: codex-sol
